<title>ITALY: Italy October wholesale prices rose 2.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Italy October wholesale prices rose 2.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>National statistics office ISTAT gave the following Italian wholesale price data for October.</p>
<p> WHOLESALE PRICES	 Oct 96     Sept 96     Oct 95</p>
<p> Year/Year change	 +2.1%	+1.3%	 +10.8%</p>
<p> Month/Month change     +0.9%	+0.4%	 +0.1%</p>
<p> Index (100 in 1990)    134.7	133.5	 131.9</p>
</text>
